sequenceDiagram
    actor B as 买家
    participant UI as 结算/支付页面
    participant OC as OrderController
    participant OS as OrderService
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant Pay as 支付宝沙箱/模拟支付
    B->>UI: 勾选多个商品并提交结算
    UI->>OC: POST /api/order/checkout
    OC->>OS: checkout(userId, cartItemIds)
    OS->>DB: 锁定并校验 AVAILABLE 商品
    OS->>OS: 按 sellerId 分组
    OS->>DB: 创建卖家子订单和商品快照
    OS->>DB: 商品更新为 RESERVED
    OS-->>UI: 返回多张待付款订单
    B->>UI: 点击支付
    UI->>OC: POST /api/order/{id}/payment + idempotencyKey
    OC->>OS: pay(orderId, userId, key)
    OS->>DB: 悲观锁读取订单并校验金额/状态
    OS->>Pay: 发起沙箱或模拟支付
    Pay-->>OS: 支付结果/回调
    OS->>DB: 验签、金额核对并记录 PAID
    OS-->>UI: 返回首次支付结果
    UI-->>B: Processing → Payment successful
